        {
          "title": "再度上榜！通威荣登2026《财富》世界500强",
          "url": "http://weixin.sogou.com/weixin?type=2&query=%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E8%A1%97%E8%A7%81%E9%97%BB+%E5%86%8D%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%8A%E6%A6%9C%EF%BC%81%E9%80%9A%E5%A8%81%E8%8D%A3%E7%99%BB2026%E3%80%8A%E8%B4%A2%E5%AF%8C%E3%80%8B%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C500%E5%BC%BA",
          "published": "Thu, 30 Jul 2026 08:16:00 +0800",
          "summary": "<div><div><div class=\"rich_media_content\" id=\"js_content\"><section label=\"edit by 135editor\"><section label=\"edit by 135editor\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><p><span><span><br /></span></span></p><section style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px; line-height: 1.6; padding-right: 16px; padding-left: 16px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\"><section><section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: 100%;\"><section><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"></svg></section><section style=\"border-right: 1px solid rgb(216, 61, 20); height: 1.2em;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"></svg></section><section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(216, 61, 20); width: 92%; padding: 8px; margin: 0.5em auto; border-radius: 0.5em; height: auto;\"><section><section><section style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">7月28日，2026年《财富》世界500强排行榜正式发布。通威集团凭借强劲的发展实力再度上榜，位列第464位。作为全球光伏行业首家《财富》世界500强企业，通威集团今年再度上榜，不仅是公司稳健发展态势的展现，更彰显了中国光伏屹立于世界舞台的强大实力与发展韧性</span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"width: 0px; margin-right: 5px; border-left: 10px solid rgb(216, 61, 20); display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.7em; vertical-align: top; line-height: 1.6em; border-top: 6px solid transparent !important; border-bottom: 6px solid transparent !important;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"></svg></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br /></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/drlGmm8nia1oGWR6BD9SCKBERUCtGVTH4QGbIz6WvHe8VicBODGeJ8JGX4duI18bo1bC14gJiazq7GL8Rx3LgCyAvE1fcAEgUATl5icUkuR0ibJY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%;\" /></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><br /></span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span>《财富》世界500强排行榜通过纵向不同年份和横向不同行业的系统比较，全面反映企业经营规模、发展质量与国际竞争力，是全球知名企业判断自身实力、衡量行业地位的重要标尺，也是观察世界经济走势的权威“晴雨表”。</span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><br /></span></span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" src=\"http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/drlGmm8nia1p4oZ5D44w4NEXvfyJAWcPZKVbcwMI02SGL2YMSicTU3bdZxH7WYvGwUIakOCtjuTIUh0BFBuaTvhv9fkgoCM6OQ385LBucxK6Y/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%;\" type=\"block\" /></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><br /></span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span wrap=\"wrap\"><span>今年《财富》世界500强排行榜企业的营业收入总和约为43.1万亿美元，超过全球GDP的三分之一，比去年增长了约3.2%。此次上榜门槛（最低销售收入）从322亿美元增长至332亿美元，较一年前提高3%。今年，加上台湾地区企业，中国共有122家公司上榜，比去年减少8家，上榜公司数量再次仅次于美国，位居第二。</span></span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span wrap=\"wrap\"><span><br /></span></span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span>在全球经济不确定性加剧、产业格局深度调整的背景下，通威集团再度上榜，不仅意味着企业综合实力获得国际权威机构的充分认可，更传递出全球资本和产业界对光伏新能源产业长远价值的高度肯定</span></span><span><span>。《财富》评价道，</span></span><span>尽管光伏行业仍处于调整期，通威集团依然保持了在高纯晶硅、太阳能电池和绿色农业领域的规模优势。公司通过推进技术创新、优化产能和拓展海外市场，持续增强应对行业周期波动的能力。</span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><br /></span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" src=\"http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/drlGmm8nia1p6kx6gHfj6oCLumWyO3DKQkF4v5xvMbPHZWzG4INGUaCLk3okZLiczddcqCmhsQE5Iho2xr6hoGhmtPkEnCN7SsicnDqvA4Jf54/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%;\" type=\"block\" /></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" src=\"http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/drlGmm8nia1qfXC6lq5fiaW27eozCNiay4xh6QaQia88icqYicKJSv2Q9zhVBjsG4zl9ABgnDFdgsibibWBjVIN2u13Oa5OKCceMr75HRu5jVP4QiaLQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%;\" type=\"block\" /></span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><br /></span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span>再度上榜世界500强的背后，是全国人大代表、全国工商联副主席、通威集团董事局刘汉元主席带领全体通威人四十四年深耕主业、苦练内功的深厚积淀，是面对行业波动始终坚守长期主义的战略定力，更是以技术创新驱动高质量发展的稳健态势。</span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><br /></span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span>作为培育光伏新质生产力的重要引擎，通威全球创新研发中心全面推进TOPCon、HJT、BC、钙钛矿/晶硅叠层等多条前沿技术路线的并行研发与中试验证，加速实验室技术向产业化成果转化，并取得了一系列重要成果。自主研发的TNC 3.0-集光系列组件双面率最高可达93.07%，引领行业；THC-G12异质结铜互连组件输出功率突破至802.43W，第十二次刷新纪录；全球首个全自动化5MW钙钛矿/硅叠层电池中试线的建成与户外实证，标志着通威在下一代光伏技术的产业化道路上迈出了关键一步。凭借雄厚的技术积淀与科研实力，通威成为“十五五”国家重点研发计划主责单位，是首家承担该项重任的民营企业。</span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><br /></span></span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/drlGmm8nia1oe7OzfhgNZVDUs9ZtLMRXOfVLwx2FNebxlfhNBEo7h5Q2g0aPDG4z7OhGy7ibdBtCDWDKL5QTLG9ibRd2LCQuGdTR9ArkfCbTfo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%;\" /></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1em; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">通威全球创新研发中心研发车间</span></span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><br /></span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span>以技术创新为核心优势，</span><span><span>目前，通威高纯晶硅连续多年蝉联全球市占率及出货量第一；太阳能电池出货量连续九年蝉联全球第一，成为行业首家累计出货量突破400GW的企业，并于2025年获评全球光伏电池行业首个“灯塔工厂”；高效组件产品已覆盖全球80多个国家和地区。一组组硬核数据，勾勒出通威在全球光伏产业链中的领军地位，也诠释了“中国智造”从跟跑到领跑的跨越。</span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><br /></span></span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1em;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/drlGmm8nia1rbFkuicf7f5dmia0BXiaQGm8QrdPeZHNGtChb1JhQb3ibiatRtwabpjUXNncwEibdGEia38ZblnMqDia5owtB2ia6oQR2bT7JsofqdD4IU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%;\" /></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1em; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">通威太阳能智能制造生产线</span></span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><br /></span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span>在夯实产业硬实力的同时，通威始终将可持续发展理念融入企业基因，深度落地<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">“Together to Win”</span>可持续发展战略，以美好生态、价值创造、和谐伙伴、稳健发展为核心方向，依托农业、新能源两大产业协同优势，全方位、全价值链推进ESG体系建设。同时，积极搭建绿色供应链体系、牵头行业ESG共建行动，以标准化、常态化、数字化的可持续管理模式，赋能产业绿色转型、守护生态环境、共创社会价值。</span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><br /></span></span></span></section><section style=\"text-align: center; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/drlGmm8nia1plSljGleiaTjEUEF24icS8RbvcEYHc4fAefyUR32Xm1waghFVh3eBMTcKBGOXTzSVEON1csEL72aubua8n5tA9Tq5qHrpMoFlE0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%;\" /></section><p style=\"text-align: center; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1em;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">永祥股份绿色工厂</span></span></p><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span><br /></span></span></span></section><section style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px; margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.6em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px;\"><span><span>从首次登榜实现“零的突破”，到再度登榜的“稳健在列”，通威集团在世界500强榜单上的稳步前行，正是中国优秀企业高质量发展的生动缩影。站在新的历史起点，通威将继续秉持长期主义，以更开放的姿态融入全球产业生态，用硬核的技术实力与可持续的发展理念，不断书写属于中国企业的崭新篇章，为全球能源转型、人类可持续发展贡献更多力量。</span></span></span></section></section></section><hr /><section label=\"edit by 135editor\"><section label=\"edit by 135editor\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\"><span><br /></span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 16px; margin-right: 16px; line-height: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><em><span><span><span>*以上内容不构成投资建议，不代表刊登<a class=\"weapp_text_link js_weapp_entry\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">平台</a>之观点，市场有风险，投资需谨慎，请独立判断和决策。</span></span></span></em></p><section><section label=\"edit by 135editor\"><section><section style=\"line-height: 0; overflow: hidden;\"><section style=\"line-height: 0; height: 0; overflow: visible;\"><section style=\"line-height: 0;\"><section style=\"line-height: 0;\"><em><svg viewBox=\"0 0 992 720\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"></svg></em></section><section style=\"line-height: 0; display: flex;\"><section style=\"line-height: 0;\"><em><span><span><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fKQ8WcQOiaXPv0AKJKJVI6gNSyI1QkqJbE8uE6VWjasaQ2mfbwKCDk2PHP1z7iakNurSqsoP9KaH41903sKNmSUw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%; height: auto !important;\" width=\"100%\" />                 </span></span></em></section><section style=\"line-height: 0; overflow: hidden;\"><section style=\"line-height: 0; height: 0; overflow: visible;\"><section style=\"line-height: 0;\"><section class=\"mp_profile_iframe_wrp\"><section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;\"><em><svg viewBox=\"0 0 992 320\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"></svg></em></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0; display: flex;\"><section style=\"line-height: 0;\"><em><span><span><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ahN42AS1lmEpgcyznLKPXty6xTdzyIlr6yvFc7chnhibCeuCaD3I4AV9P02O68zibqsHbbHtgPOWE9fg7yMrl6zA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%; height: auto !important;\" width=\"100%\" />                 </span></span></em></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;\"><em><span><span><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fKQ8WcQOiaXPv0AKJKJVI6gNSyI1QkqJbZpGNbaaZk4sY9mz4Qfg8OHLOS8PyLUqITGbDKfpFoIETwWMAEXCI4Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%; height: auto !important;\" width=\"100%\" />                 </span></span></em></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0; display: flex;\"><section style=\"line-height: 0;\"><em><span><span><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fKQ8WcQOiaXPv0AKJKJVI6gNSyI1QkqJbfjd1l5n7vaZtrw6ichbTAdtIvqsicwicdIa7wLW7pcia1vwbUkJOhU3dGQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%; height: auto !important;\" width=\"100%\" />                 </span></span></em></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;\"><em><span><span><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" src=\"http://img2.jintiankansha.me/get?src=http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fKQ8WcQOiaXPv0AKJKJVI6gNSyI1QkqJbTxPVBuO6UDP4H1epyPssA3uCrn2Pcd8C8QeyJqyucXrdcsV4HG5Kmg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline; width: 100%; height: auto !important;\" width=\"100%\" />           </span></span></em></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"></p></div>\n    \n\n    \n    <br />\n\n    \n\n    \n        <div>\n            平台地址：<a href=\"http://www.jintiankansha.me/t/Nxj8irrtF7\">http://www.jintiankansha.me/t/Nxj8irrtF7</a>\n        </div>\n    \n\n    <img alt=\"\" class=\"\" height=\"1px\" src=\"http://www.jintiankansha.me/rss_static/138655/Nxj8irrtF7\" style=\"width: 1px; height: 1px; display: none;\" width=\"1px\" /></div></div>",
